<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Ryan Carvalho — Portfolio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #111118;
      --border: #1e1e2e;
      --accent: #7cffb2;
      --accent2: #ff6b6b;
      --accent3: #ffd166;
      --text: #e8e8f0;
      --muted: #6b6b80;
      --card: #13131c;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      cursor: none;
    }

    /* CURSOR */
    .cursor {
      width: 12px; height: 12px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      transition: transform 0.1s ease;
      mix-blend-mode: difference;
    }
    .cursor-ring {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9998;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, width 0.2s, height 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    /* NOISE OVERLAY */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
      background: rgba(10,10,15,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-status {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .status-dot {
      width: 7px; height: 7px;
      background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.7); }
    }

    /* HERO */
    #hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 0 4rem;
      position: relative;
      padding-top: 6rem;
    }
    .hero-tag {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s forwards;
    }
    .hero-name {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s forwards;
    }
    .hero-name span { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero-role {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.6s forwards;
    }
    .hero-greeting-wrap {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.8s forwards;
      max-width: 460px;
    }
    .greeting-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    #hero-input {
      background: transparent;
      border: none; outline: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      width: 200px;
    }
    #hero-greeting {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      min-height: 1.2rem;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      display: flex; gap: 1rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 1s forwards;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      cursor: none;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

    /* grid decoration */
    .hero-grid {
      position: absolute;
      right: 4rem; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 1s 1.2s forwards;
    }
    .hero-grid svg { width: 300px; height: 300px; }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* SECTIONS COMMON */
    section { padding: 6rem 4rem; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
    }
    .section-label::after {
      content: '';
      height: 1px; flex: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border), transparent);
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    /* SOBRE */
    #sobre .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .about-text p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .about-text p span { color: var(--text); }
    .about-stats {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .stat-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .stat-desc { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.3rem; }

    /* QUIZ */
    #quiz {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .quiz-box {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .quiz-question {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .quiz-options {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .quiz-opt {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
      cursor: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text);
      text-align: left;
    }
    .quiz-opt:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .quiz-opt.selected { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(124,255,178,0.07); color: var(--accent); }
    .quiz-result {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      display: none;
    }
    .quiz-result.show { display: block; animation: fadeUp 0.4s forwards; }

    /* HABILIDADES */
    .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .skill-chip {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
    }
    .skill-chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .skill-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* PROJETOS */
    .projects-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
    .project-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.25s;
    }
    .project-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,50%), rgba(124,255,178,0.07), transparent 60%);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }
    .project-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
    .project-card:hover { border-color: rgba(124,255,178,0.3); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .project-num {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .project-title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }
    .project-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .project-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .tag {
      background: rgba(124,255,178,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,255,178,0.2);
      color: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    /* FRASE MOTIVACIONAL */
    #motivacional { background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .quote-box {
      max-width: 700px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    #quote-text {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      min-height: 3rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    #quote-pt {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      min-height: 1.2rem;
    }
    .quote-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      cursor: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .quote-btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent3); color: var(--accent3); }
    .quote-loader { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.8rem; min-height: 1rem; }

    /* CONTATO */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .contact-info p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .contact-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }
    .contact-link {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .contact-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .form-field {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .form-field label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .form-field input,
    .form-field textarea {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .form-field input:focus, .form-field textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
    .form-field textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
    #form-msg { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); min-height: 1rem; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 2rem 4rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    footer span { color: var(--accent); }

    /* COUNTDOWN */
    .countdown-box {
      display: flex; gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .cd-unit { text-align: center; }
    .cd-num {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent3);
      display: block;
    }
    .cd-label { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

    /* DARK MODE toggle */
    .theme-toggle {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      cursor: none;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .theme-toggle:hover { border-color: var(--accent3); color: var(--accent3); }

    body.light {
      --bg: #f4f4f0;
      --surface: #ebebdf;
      --border: #d0d0c0;
      --text: #1a1a1a;
      --muted: #777;
      --card: #fafaf5;
    }

    /* SCROLL REVEAL */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      #hero { padding: 6rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
      .hero-grid { display: none; }
      #sobre .about-grid,
      .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- CURSOR -->
  <div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
  <div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">ryan.dev</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li>
      <li><a href="#habilidades">Skills</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projetos">Projetos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;">
      <div class="nav-status">
        <div class="status-dot"></div>
        Disponível para trabalho
      </div>
      <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeBtn">☀ Tema</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-tag">// desenvolvedor front-end</div>
    <h1 class="hero-name">Ryan<br><span>Carvalho</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-role">Transformando ideias em interfaces incríveis.</p>

    <div class="hero-greeting-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="greeting-label">Olá! Qual é o seu nome?</div>
        <input id="hero-input" type="text" placeholder="Digite seu nome..." autocomplete="off"/>
        <div id="hero-greeting"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#projetos" class="btn btn-primary">Ver Projetos</a>
      <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-outline">Entrar em Contato</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-grid">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none">
        <defs>
          <pattern id="grid" width="30" height="30" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <path d="M 30 0 L 0 0 0 30" fill="none" stroke="#1e1e2e" stroke-width="1"/>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="300" height="300" fill="url(#grid)"/>
        <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="80" stroke="#7cffb2" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="8 4" opacity="0.4">
          <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 150 150" to="360 150 150" dur="20s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
        <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="50" stroke="#ff6b6b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.3">
          <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="360 150 150" to="0 150 150" dur="15s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
        <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="8" fill="#7cffb2" opacity="0.8"/>
        <text x="150" y="258" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Mono" font-size="10" fill="#6b6b80">{ in orbit }</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOBRE -->
  <section id="sobre">
    <div class="section-label">01 — sobre mim</div>
    <div class="section-title">Quem sou eu?</div>
    <div class="about-grid reveal">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          Olá, sou <span>Ryan Carvalho Silva</span>, desenvolvedor apaixonado por criar experiências
          digitais que unem <span>design e tecnologia</span> de forma elegante e funcional.
        </p>
        <p>
          Trabalho com <span>HTML, CSS e JavaScript</span>, focando na manipulação dinâmica do DOM
          para construir interfaces interativas e responsivas. Gosto de transformar problemas complexos
          em soluções simples e visualmente atraentes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Estou em constante evolução, explorando novas ferramentas e tecnologias para elevar a
          qualidade do meu trabalho.
        </p>

        <!-- COUNTDOWN -->
        <div style="margin-top:2rem;">
          <div class="greeting-label" style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">⏳ Contador até a formatura (Dez/2026)</div>
          <div class="countdown-box" id="countdown"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num" id="weekday-display">—</div>
          <div class="stat-desc">Hoje é</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">JS</div>
          <div class="stat-desc">Linguagem principal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num">∞</div>
          <div class="stat-desc">Vontade de aprender</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num" style="color:var(--accent2)">✓</div>
          <div class="stat-desc">Status acadêmico: aprovado</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUIZ -->
  <section id="quiz">
    <div class="section-label">02 — quiz de perfil</div>
    <div class="section-title">Front-End ou Back-End?</div>
    <div class="quiz-box reveal">
      <div